## Installation

Add `nimbus` to your `build.gradle` dependencies. Optionally add `nimbus-ktor` for the ready-made Ktor HTTP adapter.

```kotlin
dependencies {
    implementation("io.github.giovanniandreuzza:nimbus:$VERSION")
    // Optional — recommended Ktor HTTP adapter:
    implementation("io.github.giovanniandreuzza:nimbus-ktor:$VERSION")
}
```

